---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Microdose"
letter: "M"
anchor: "microdose"
category: "edibles"
---

A very small cannabis dose — typically 1–5mg THC — intended to produce subtle effects without significant intoxication. People who microdose often say they do it to stay focused, creative, or calm through the day. Cannabis sugar and tinctures are the most practical formats for precise microdosing at home because they can be measured in small, consistent amounts.

→ [Cannabis Edibles Potency Calculator](/edibles-calculator/), [Cannabis-Infused Sugar](/edibles/cannabis-sugar/)
